{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07673","headline":"晚春卧病寄张八 · 孟浩然","name":"晚春卧病寄张八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南陌春将晚，北窗犹卧病。\n林园久不游，草木一何盛。\n狭迳花障迷，闲庭竹扫净。\n翠羽戏兰苕，赬鳞动荷柄。\n念我平生好，江乡远从政。\n云山阻梦思，衾枕劳歌咏。\n歌咏复何爲，同心恨别离。\n世途皆自媚，流俗寡相知。\n贾谊才空逸，安仁鬓欲丝。\n遥情每东注，奔晷复西驰。\n常恐填沟壑，无由振羽仪。\n穷通若有命，欲向论中推。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07673.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07673","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}